%% Title: Object model · pipeline modules, workers and queues
%% Summary: The scoring pipeline modules and what each exports, the methodology resolver, the BullMQ queues on Valkey and the worker handlers that consume them (incl. the maintenance schedulers), the audit replay module and the external watchdog.
%% Sources: src/pipeline/*.js, src/collectors/ai-filter.js, src/queues/{index,connection,pending}.js, src/workers/*.js, src/db/pool-size.js (workerConcurrency), src/audit/replay.js, src/watchdog/*.js, scripts/watchdog.js, src/config/methodology-registry.js (CURRENT_VERSIONS), docker-compose.yml (redis service = Valkey 8). Updated 2026-09-29. Spec: TECHNICAL_SPEC.md sections 9, 10, 12, 18, 19, 20. Versions are CURRENT_VERSIONS of the methodology registry.
